<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 221-8 IN 50 OVERS V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 221-8 IN 50 OVERS V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH, South Africa 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa scored 221 for eight off their 50 overs in the second one-day international against Australia at St George's Park on Monday.</p>
</text>
